# The repo-root .gitignore excludes "build-*" to keep build directories out.
# Every golden-render case is named after its tests-scene script, and those are
# all called build-<something>.js, so that rule also swallows every reference
# PNG in here -- silently: "git add refs/" stages the .txt files, reports no
# error, and commits a reference set with no images in it. That is exactly how
# refs/llvmpipe/ came to exist as an empty directory while the gate it feeds
# reported Skipped in every CI run for a whole campaign.
!build-*
